# Allowlist: the build context is ONLY what is re-included below. The repository
# directory also holds gitignored secrets and local config (.dev.vars,
# wrangler.jsonc, config-live/, ...), and the Compose .env sits in
# src/hosts/node/; none of it may reach an image. Only TypeScript source is
# re-included from src/. Buildah/Podman drop an excluded directory together
# with everything under it, so directories can't be excluded and re-entered;
# instead every file with a dot in its name (.env, .env.*, *.sqlite*,
# compose.yaml, ...) and every dotfile is dropped, then *.ts is restored.
# Extensionless files are not matched; the Dockerfile fails the build if one
# reaches it.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!tsconfig.json
!scripts/build-node.mjs
!src/
src/**/*.*
src/**/.*
src/**/Dockerfile
!src/**/*.ts
